  "title": "Avocado Soup with Chicken and Lime",
  "description": "Strips of chicken breast are simmered in a spicy, citrusy broth, and topped with avocado and crisp corn tortilla strips for a satisfying meal that&#39;s ready in about 30 minutes.",
